bg=#B8E6B0</panel_attributes><additional_attributes /></element><element><id>Relation</id><coordinates><x>975</x><y>-8</y><w>43</w><h>15</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>lt=.&gt;</panel_attributes><additional_attributes>0;16;43;0</additional_attributes></element><element><id>Relation</id><coordinates><x>499</x><y>126</y><w>10</w><h>31</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>lt=.&gt;</panel_attributes><additional_attributes>1;0;0;31</additional_attributes></element><element><id>Relation</id><coordinates><x>440</x><y>1294</y><w>10</w><h>33</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>lt=.&gt;</panel_attributes><additional_attributes>0;0;2;33</additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>329</x><y>1542</y><w>1000</w><h>76</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>NEW IN STAGE 2 (green): ShellPanel is used by MainWindow; WealthSeiFactory is used by Main; ArgTokenizer is used by CliApp; Main is the program entry
point and uses WealthSeiFactory.
Old classes show only the members that were in Stage 1 and still exist; members that are unchanged are not repeated. Every changed or new class
(orange / green) lists its current members in its box.
bg=#E6F2FF</panel_attributes><additional_attributes /></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>329</x><y>1630</y><w>1000</w><h>48</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>STAGE 2 LEGEND: orange = changed from Stage 1 (renamed, new signature or fields, handlers/private fields dropped); green = new in Stage 2, placed next
to the class that uses it (dashed arrow = uses; hollow-triangle line = inheritance/implements; "used by" lists every user). Unmarked = unchanged.
bg=#FFF2A8</panel_attributes><additional_attributes /></element></diagram>